 adage    1 Live   2 Reflexes (2)  3 Map   4 Health (2)  5 Settings                                                            harbor-dispatch · LIVE
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 config  /home/me/.local/share/adage/config.toml
 the same settings as adage config; environment variables win over the file

▌learn.auto               false    (file)
   condition automatically, in the background, when an agent session stops or ends
 learn.min_interval_secs  120      (default)
   at most one automatic conditioning run per repository in this many seconds (0 to 86400)
 learn.thresholds         default  (default)
   evidence bars for `adage condition` and automatic conditioning: default, or demo (lower)
 learn.claude_projects    ""       (default)
   Claude Code traces to condition on ("" = ~/.claude/projects)
 learn.codex_sessions     auto     (default)
   Codex rollouts to condition on: auto (once Codex hooks are registered), a directory, or "" (none)
 learn.opencode_exports   ""       (default)
   a directory of `opencode export` files automatic conditioning reads ("" = none)
 learn.parse_cache        true     (default)
   keep parsed traces in cache/sessions so conditioning again parses only what changed
 learn.cards              true     (default)
   learn procedure cards for families of similar tasks (with the installed or bundled model)
 learn.card_threshold     0.811    (default)
   how similar a prompt must be to a family's prompts for its procedure card (0.5 to 0.99)
 instincts.enabled        true     (default)
   bind Adage's built-in defaults (instincts) from each repository's declared files
 instincts.packs          core     (default)
   instinct packs to bind, comma-separated (only core exists)
 instincts.disabled       ""       (default)
   instinct ids never to bind, comma-separated, e.g. U3,N1 (see docs/instincts.md)
 ui.notices               daily    (default)
   one-line notices at session start (Claude Code): daily, only when something is new; or off
 runtime.control          0.1      (default)
   share of sessions held out as the control arm (Adage decides but says nothing)
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
